   "roundness": null,
   "text": "DEEPER \u2014 THE VALUE, IN UNITS. what is this worth, and to whom:\nempty seats filled? fan goodwill? money? every fatal-risk verdict\nand every priority call downstream divides by this number, and it\nhas exactly one source: you.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
