   "originalText": "DEEPER \u2014 UK LAW MAKES UNAUTHORISED FOOTBALL TICKET RESALE A\nCRIMINAL OFFENCE (s.166 CJPOA 1994 \u2014 from training data; have\ncounsel verify). impact >= the declared value at ANY likelihood =\nFATAL. the only countermeasure class visible is CLUB AUTHORISATION\n\u2014 which makes partner-with-Celtic the survival condition, not a\nfeature. face-value-only exchange between verified holders may be\nthe one lawful shape. this risk can reshape or kill the idea.",
