   "roundness": null,
   "text": "two axes, both outcome: consequence \u00d7 value. every candidate names\nWHAT WE LOSE by not choosing it; blocked items are separated, not\nranked. the first pick writes itself: the club-authorisation\nconversation \u2014 highest consequence, and it gates everything else\non this page.",
