   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1785400000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "gen": "kerd"
   },
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "one conversation \u2192 docs/design/celtic-ticket-exchange.md +\n.excalidraw: detailed specs, architecture (ticket custody, QR\nre-issue, seat map, identity), testing strategy, diagrams for as\nmany aspects as we can. grounding: standing decisions \u00b7 what we\nruled out \u00b7 the living design docs of whatever this touches.\nGO is two keys: everything drawn and nothing left to annotate\n(you) \u00b7 every stage-2 measurement has a NAMED ANSWER (machine).\nGO writes docs/gates/<date>-celtic-ticket-exchange-design.md.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "one conversation \u2192 docs/design/celtic-ticket-exchange.md +\n.excalidraw: detailed specs, architecture (ticket custody, QR\nre-issue, seat map, identity), testing strategy, diagrams for as\nmany aspects as we can. grounding: standing decisions \u00b7 what we\nruled out \u00b7 the living design docs of whatever this touches.\nGO is two keys: everything drawn and nothing left to annotate\n(you) \u00b7 every stage-2 measurement has a NAMED ANSWER (machine).\nGO writes docs/gates/<date>-celtic-ticket-exchange-design.md.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
