   "roundness": null,
   "text": "DEEPER \u2014 THE LOOP MAY NOT RUN YET. nothing in any repo can refuse\nfrom outside the model: 0 CI workflows, 0 hooks. until a check can\nBLOCK, this page is a description, not a machine. CI is the first\nbuild item for exactly this reason \u2014 and deciding its shape (what\nrefuses, where, on what signal) is yours.",
