   "originalText": "cold eyes see ONLY the work order and the change \u2014 verdict can\nBLOCK. per-layer conformance, never one verdict: code \u00b7 logic \u00b7\narchitecture \u00b7 pixel vs the approved design \u00b7 the product\nmeasurements (an exchange completes end-to-end, the seat\ntransfers, the empty-seat number moves). then the human key.",
