   "roundness": null,
   "text": "the gate record is dated and kept; the code IS the product truth;\nwhat was ruled out is on the record and read in grounding by the\nnext round \u2014 a dead option stays dead. the next slice (away\nfixtures? cup games? guest passes?) enters at the gates \u2014 and\nenters LOWER, because its upstream declarations now exist.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
